// ===================================================================================================================================
// File          : TC_01_ENTS.java
// Package       : stepdefinitions.ENTS
// Description   : Step definitions for TC_01_ENTS — Transfer Application E2E Regression Pack (Same Agent).
//
//                 Covers the full Transferor → Transferee cycle for all 7 transfer types:
//                   206 (Change of Legal Entity), 201 (Change of Registration / Inheritance),
//                   202 (Gift), 211 (Lease), 204 (Division), 212 (Sale)
//
//                 Reused steps (defined elsewhere, bound automatically by Cucumber):
//                   "the agent user is on the login page"                            → TC_03.java
//                   "the individual logs in as transferor {string}"                  → TC_08_ENTS.java
//                   "the agent opens the {string} application"                       → TC_03.java
//                   "the agent should land on the BISS Home page"                    → TC_03.java
//                   "the agent navigates to the {string} and {string} Left Menu Link"→ TC_03.java
//                   "the agent switches to the {string} tab on the My Client(s) page"→ TC_06.java
//                   "the ETF partner completes the transferee acceptance flow"       → TC_07_ENTS.java
//
//                 Playwright edition (22-09-2026):
//                   - Same step texts, same ObjectRepository keys, same flow.
//                   - Runtime test data: a DataTable value written as a token, e.g. {transferor.herd}, is replaced by
//                     a random unused herd from the ENTS Agent Login query (utilities.EntsTestData). Plain values
//                     still work, so a herd can be pinned for debugging.
//                   - findElements / JavascriptExecutor / WebDriverWait replaced by Playwright locators (EntsSession).
//                   - Logout uses the shared EntsSession.logout().
//                   - 24-09-2026: transferee search selects the row with no End Date when the dialog shows
//                     "N matches found" (EntsSession.selectOpenTransfereeMatch).
//                   - 29-09-2026: cross-agent sections (TC_04_ENTS) - a transfereeAgent row takes the transferee herd
//                     from that agent's pool (EntsTestData.nextCrossAgentPair); {transferee.agent} names that agent.
//                   - 30-09-2026: agent-to-individual sections (TC_05_ENTS / TC_06_ENTS) - a "transfereeType | Individual"
//                     row takes the transferee herd from the Individual Login query (EntsTestData.nextAgentToIndividualPair);
//                     {transferee.login} names the individual's own login.
//                   - 30-09-2026: "Leased entitlements can only be transferred by ..." after Next on the entitlements page
//                     - the step clicks Back, selects ents.leased.fallback.type (an allowed type) and adds the
//                     entitlement again (handleLeasedEntitlementsError).
//                   - 22-09-2026 (TC_18 to TC_24 drop): "Validate if Appeal can be made sucessfully" checks its Object
//                     Repository keys first and always logs out (see the step comment).
//
//                 02-10-2026: the create step uses EntsSession.searchTransferee. On "No transferee matches were found"
//                 a runtime transferee is replaced (EntsTestData.replaceTransferee) and searched again in the same
//                 dialog, up to ents.transferee.retries (default 3).
//
// Author        : Aniket Pathare | aniket.pathare@government.ie
// Date Created  : 31-03-2026 | Updated: 22-09-2026 (Playwright + runtime ENTS data), 02-10-2026 (transferee no match)
